Voice-aware piano transcription

This project builds on the following third-party work.

## Piano transcription model and pretrained weights

Kong, Q., Li, B., Song, X., Wan, Y., Wang, Y. "High-Resolution Piano
Transcription with Pedals by Regressing Onsets and Offsets Times." 2020.
Code: https://github.com/bytedance/piano_transcription (Apache License 2.0).
A pinned subset is vendored under `third_party/piano_transcription/`; see
that directory's own LICENSE and NOTICE for the exact commit and files.

## Datasets

- MAESTRO v2.0.0 (Google Magenta / Google LLC), used under its stated
  license. See https://magenta.tensorflow.org/datasets/maestro.
- MUSDB18-HQ, used under its stated license. See
  https://sigsep.github.io/datasets/musdb.html.

## Pitch extraction

Pitch labels use RMVPE or CREPE (torchcrepe), per the method described in
`docs/method.md`. Checkpoint provenance and licensing are recorded there.

No other third-party code, weights, or data are included in this
repository.
